@startuml lld-us12-sequence
title LLD-US12 Receive a monthly e-statement: sequence diagram
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber
participant Scheduler
participant MonthEndJob
participant StatementService
participant MailGateway
Scheduler -> MonthEndJob : run()
MonthEndJob -> StatementService : pdf(acc, month)
MonthEndJob -> MailGateway : send(pdf)
@enduml